# =====================
# ML / Data
# =====================
# Large dataset zips — tracked via Git LFS (see .gitattributes)
# datasets/  <-- removed; now handled by Git LFS
# Large trained model files — tracked via Git LFS (see .gitattributes)
# models/*.pkl  <-- removed; now handled by Git LFS
# Intermediate processed files (keep structure, ignore data)
processed/tabular/*.csv
processed/audio_features/*.csv
# CatBoost training artifacts — included in repo
# catboost_info/  <-- removed; now tracked

